00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:26.730
Lo lamento.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.450
Parece que he ofrecido
la muestra equivocada de sinceridad.

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:51.150
Señora Anna.

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:01.030
Este

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.840
Contiene la fórmula
